          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "13.（8分）求解如下递归式，解使用渐进形式（复杂度的阶的形式）即可。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.11,
            0.341,
            0.13
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(提示:设 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "n { = } 2 ^ { m }  。"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " )"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.255,
            0.141,
            0.519,
            0.183
          ],
          "content": "T ( n ) = \\left\\{ \\begin{aligned} & 1 \\\\ & 2 T \\left( \\sqrt { n } \\right) + \\log _ { 2 } n \\end{aligned} \\right."
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
