    {
      "page_idx": 5,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.105,
            0.078,
            0.589,
            0.102
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "第三部分、算法设计与分析。（共50分）"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.104,
            0.116,
            0.879,
            0.163
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "14. （共13分)假设A[1..n]是有n个不同元素的数组，若1≤i<j≤n且A[i]>A[j]，则称(i,j)为A中的一个逆序对。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.155,
            0.169,
            0.578,
            0.19
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(1）列出数列(2,3,8,6,1)的5个逆序对。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.104,
            0.196,
            0.893,
            0.244
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（2）给出一个计算由n个元素组成的数组的逆序对数量的算法，时间复杂度为Θ(n 1g n)。（提示:修改归并排序算法。)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.252,
            0.289,
            0.277
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "回答（题14）:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.476,
            0.918,
            0.523,
            0.931
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "6 / 12"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 6,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.104,
            0.079,
            0.893,
            0.18
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "15.（共12分）给定任务集合 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "S = \\{ a_{1}, a_{2}, \\ldots, a_{n} \\}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ，其中任务 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\cdot a i"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 在启动后需要 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\cdot p i"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 个时间单位完成。你有一台计算机来运行这些任务，每个时刻只能运行一个任务.令 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "c i"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 表示任务 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\cdot a i"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的完成时刻，即任务 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\cdot a i"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 被执行完的时刻。你的目标是最小化平均完成时刻 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\textstyle ( 1 / n ) \\sum _ { i = 1 } ^ { n } c _ { i }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " C"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.105,
            0.186,
            0.893,
            0.26
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "例如，假定有2个任务 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "^ { \\cdot a _ { 1 } }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 和 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "a _ { 2 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ， "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "p _ { 1 } { = } 3"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "p _ { 2 } { = } 5"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ，如果 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "a _ { 2 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 首先运行，然后 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "a _ { 1 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 运行，那么 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "c_{2}=5,\\ c_{1}=8"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ，平均完成时刻为 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "(5+8)/2=6.5"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ；而如果 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\cdot a _ { 1 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 首先运行，然后"
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "a _ { 2 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 运行，那么 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "c _ { 1 } { = } 3"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "c _ { 2 } { = } 8"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ，平均完成时刻为 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "(3+8)/2=5.5"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " o"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.105,
            0.266,
            0.893,
            0.313
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "请设计一个贪心算法，求平均完成时刻最小的调度方案。任务的执行都是非抢占的，即一旦任务 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "a i ]"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 开始执行，它就将持续运行 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\dot { \\mathbf { \\nabla } } p _ { i }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 个时间单位。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.319,
            0.566,
            0.339
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（1）请详细描述所用到的贪心选择性质。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.105,
            0.346,
            0.902,
            0.393
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（2）请写出你的算法伪代码，不得使用具体程序设计语言的实际编码或调用任何库函数，但可以直接使用排序函数并按照你所定义的排序方式进行排序。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.399,
            0.891,
            0.419
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(3)请证明你所用到的贪心选择性质的正确性，并分析算法的时间复杂度。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "chart",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.097,
            0.425,
            0.904,
            0.913
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "chart_body",
              "index": 6,
